    "title": "Family announces memorial scholarship in honor of Levi Eric Wyatt Jr. - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Keith Phillips ,\n11 hours ago\nVICKSBURG, Miss. (VDN) — The family of Levi Eric Wyatt Jr. has announced the establishment of the Levi Eric Wyatt Jr. Memorial Scholarship to honor his memory and continue his legacy by helping a graduating high school senior pursue higher education. The scholarship, announced in honor of Wyatt’s birthday,...\nRead full article\n7",
